      "side": 1,
      "message": "this change was added because previously there was a `stdin` inside the `DAWN_UNSAFE_TODO` macro, which triggered the `-Werror,-Wdisabled-macro-expansion` compiler error, related to expand a macro inside a macro.\n\nTo solve this there was two options: to locally disable warning, or to use local variables for the macro. For the first option, pragmas are needed, and also some similar behavior could be introduced.\n\nAlso there is a third option, which is to keep the file-level exclusions (do not remove `#pragma allow_unsafe_buffers`)",
      "parentUuid": "bf63ea5a_f0c0b871",
